{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the cloud, pressure is crushing. Only machines survive in the open.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lamina Bruise</i>\u00a0is a narrative-driven, first-person adventure with puzzle elements. It tells a surreal sci-fi story through oddly familiar organic interfaces, technologies and environments, without relying on text exposition.  <br>A singular, tense yet meditative experience, taking the player on a visual journey with minimal, playful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860280/extras/9b34462295dfbac127c6795456dee231.avif?t=1763960168\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2860280?t=1763960168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860280/40d3043aa3066fb91f64b404ef0dd178db3d87b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763960168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860280/f07db7454490a56c443c2b1b75dce0f5386818fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763960168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860280/f07db7454490a56c443c2b1b75dce0f5386818fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763960168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the cloud, pressure is crushing. Only machines survive in the open.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lamina Bruise</i>\u00a0is a narrative-driven, first-person adventure with puzzle elements. It tells a surreal sci-fi story through oddly familiar organic interfaces, technologies and environments, without relying on text exposi